Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 17:17:35 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] GPU and disks: Android's Adreno and storage

An app on Android has no udev, DRM device, udisks, /sys/block or
/proc/diskstats, so both plugins found nothing.

- GPU: Adreno through KGSL's sysfs (/sys/class/kgsl/kgsl-3d0): usage,
  frequency and temperature.
- Disks: without block devices or /proc/diskstats, one "Internal Storage"
  volume: the root file system's space (statvfs) and the bytes the visible
  processes read and write (/proc/<pid>/io).
---
